  "name": "Chicken Burrito Bowl",
  "subtitle": "A colorful bowl with chicken, rice, beans, and fresh toppings",
  "description": "Roasted sweet potato, seasoned chicken, rice, beans, and fresh vegetables come together with avocado and crisp tortilla strips.",
